A documentation banner before :CLASS. Comments are not script code, so
diag.class_or_script must stay silent. Should be clean.
-- input.ssl --
/*
 * Class: SampleLabel
 * Description: Builds printable labels for samples
;
/* Revision notes live in source control;
:CLASS SampleLabel;
:DECLARE sSampleId;

:PROCEDURE Text;
	:RETURN "Sample " + Me:sSampleId;
:ENDPROC;
